    "blurb": "Simulate any connector for testing",
    "overview": "The Chameleon connector mimics any connector so you can build and test processes before the real integration is ready. Simulate delays, produce variables, trigger BPMN errors, or work with documents on demand.",
    "rating": null,
    "reviewCount": 0,
    "mobileBundleId": null,
    "mobileAppStoreId": null
  },
  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Simulate any Camunda connector",
    "splashDescription": "Waiting for a connector to be built can stall process development and testing. The Chameleon connector mimics any connector, so you can keep building without the wait. Use it as a placeholder to simulate delays, produce variables, trigger BPMN errors on demand, or work with documents. Teams can validate process logic early and catch issues before the real integration is in place.",
